  "event.lluvias.letter": "HEAVY RAINS^The recent rains brought record harvests across the Valley and the markets are saturated.",
  "event.langostas.headline": "Locust plague in the countryside: wheat and corn soar.",
  "event.langostas.letter": "LOCUST PLAGUE^A swarm of locusts devastated the fields of inner Ferngill. Wheat and corn are rising in Zuzu City and analysts expect the rally to cool down over the next two weeks.",
  "event.cosecha-gotoro.headline": "Record harvest in the Gotoro Empire: grains fall.",
  "event.cosecha-gotoro.letter": "RECORD HARVEST IN GOTORO^The Gotoro Empire brought in the largest grain harvest in its history and its exports are flooding the market. Local wheat and corn lose value.^Producers who can store may prefer to wait.",
  "event.helada.headline": "Early frost: pumpkin and fall grains go up.",
  "event.helada.letter": "EARLY FROST^An early frost damaged fall crops in the north. Pumpkins are in high demand.",
  "event.feria-huevo.headline": "The Egg Festival is coming: eggs sell for more.",
  "event.feria-huevo.letter": "EGG FESTIVAL^With the Egg Festival around the corner, demand for eggs in Pelican Town is at its peak.",
  "event.ola-calor.headline": "Heat wave: animals produce less and milk goes up.",
  "event.ola-calor.letter": "HEAT WAVE^High temperatures are lowering the output of the region's dairies. Milk and, to a lesser extent, eggs are rising.",
  "event.huelga-minera.headline": "Mining strike in Calico: copper, iron and gold go up.",
  "event.huelga-minera.letter": "STRIKE AT THE CALICO MINES^Miners in the Calico desert stopped work demanding better wages. While the conflict lasts, copper, iron and gold are scarce.",
  "event.nueva-veta.headline": "New vein in Calico: minerals fall.",
  "event.nueva-veta.letter": "NEW VEIN IN CALICO^A mining company announced a huge vein in the Calico desert. The market expects more supply and mineral prices are falling.",
  "event.marea-roja.headline": "Red tide in the Gem Sea: fish is scarce.",
