  // Phase 8: Stock Agency, Julián Ferreyra, GMCM and compatibility
  "agency.name": "Valle Inversiones Stock Agency",
  "julian.name": "Julián Ferreyra",
  "julian.gift.love": "Well, look at this! Just what I needed to survive the trading day. Thanks, @.$h",
  "julian.gift.like": "How thoughtful. Thank you, really.",
  "julian.gift.dislike": "Oh... uh, thanks. I'll put it in a drawer somewhere.",
  "julian.gift.hate": "Is this a joke? Not even the worst junk bond is worth this little.$s",
  "julian.gift.neutral": "Thanks, @.",
  "julian.dialogue.intro": "Welcome to Valle Inversiones! I'm Julián Ferreyra, your stockbroker.#$b#If you want to invest, the Terminal is right over there. And if you have questions, ask me: that's what I'm here for.$h",
  "julian.dialogue.Mon": "Mondays the market always opens nervous. Something always happens over the weekend.",
  "julian.dialogue.Tue": "Golden rule: never put the money you need for seeds into the market.",
  "julian.dialogue.Wed": "Midweek. A good time to review your portfolio calmly.",
  "julian.dialogue.Thu": "Have you seen the bond curve? Sometimes it says more than all the newspapers together.",
  "julian.dialogue.Fri": "Friday! If you close the week in the green, drinks are on me at the Saloon.$h",
  "julian.dialogue.Sat": "The market is closed on Saturdays, but I keep looking at the numbers. Occupational hazard.",
  "julian.dialogue.Sun": "Sunday. The Agency is closed... but if it's urgent, the Terminal still works.",
  "julian.dialogue.Mon6": "@, you know you're one of my favorite clients? Don't tell anyone.$h",
  "julian.dialogue.Tue6": "I saved a good tip for you on Monday. Check your mailbox.",
  "julian.dialogue.Wed6": "Years ago, when I started, I lost everything in a week. That's why I'm so careful now.",
  "julian.dialogue.Thu6": "Your commission is already the lowest at the Agency. Keep it between us.$h",
  "julian.dialogue.Fri6": "A coffee before the closing bell? My treat.$h",
  "julian.dialogue.Sat6": "Sometimes I think about quitting and planting parsnips. Then I remember inflation.",
  "julian.dialogue.Sun6": "On Sundays I like reading old balance sheets. Yes, I know... I'm hopeless.$h",
  "julian.dialogue.AcceptGift_395": "Coffee! The official fuel of the capital markets.$h",
  "julian.dialogue.AcceptBirthdayGift_Positive": "You remembered my birthday? This is worth more than any dividend.$h",
  "julian.dialogue.AcceptBirthdayGift_Negative": "Well... thanks for remembering, anyway.",
  "julian.market.up": "Good morning! The MERZU rose {{merzu}} yesterday and the BCRF rate is at {{rate}}. A day for optimism.$h",
  "julian.market.down": "The MERZU fell {{merzu}} yesterday. With the BCRF rate at {{rate}}, we need to be careful.$s",
  "julian.market.flat": "The MERZU is flat ({{merzu}}) and the BCRF rate is at {{rate}}. A quiet day.",
  "julian.market.embargo": "I see you have an attachment order... I can't open new positions for you until it's lifted. Think about filing for insolvency.$s",
  "julian.market.overdue": "Careful, you have overdue bills. Pay them before you get a formal notice: I can take payment right here.",
  "julian.market.portfolio": "Your portfolio is worth {{value}} today. Want to go over it?",
  "julian.market.no-account": "You still haven't opened your brokerage account? Do it at the Terminal: it's free.",
  "julian.market.listed": "And your company on the exchange! {{ticker}} trades at {{price}}. Not bad, @.$h",
  "julian.tip.title": "A tip from Julián",
  "julian.tip.up": "Dear @:^A tip, between us: {{name}} is gaining strength. I figure it'll rise about {{change}} this week. If you have some to sell, it may pay to wait.^^Best regards.",
  "julian.tip.down": "Dear @:^A tip, between us: {{name}} is weakening. I figure it'll drop about {{change}} this week. If you have some to sell, better now than later.^^Best regards.",
  "julian.tip.none": "Dear @:^The market looks calm this week. A good time to tidy up your portfolio.^^Best regards.",
  "julian.event2.a": "@! Come in, come in. I was just thinking about you.",
  "julian.event2.b": "You know why I opened the Agency in such a small town? In Zuzu City I was just one more. Here I can help people grow what they sow.$h",
  "julian.event2.c": "So thanks for trusting me. You know where to find me.",
  "julian.event4.a": "@... did you hear? The issuer I recommended to half the town defaulted.$s",
  "julian.event4.b": "I was so sure. The numbers added up. But the market forgives no one, not even those who think they understand it.",
  "julian.event4.c": "Thanks for not running away like the others. It helps more than you think.$h",
  "julian.event6.a": "@, I have something for you.$h",
  "julian.event6.b": "From today you get my preferred commission: the one I only give to real clients. And every Monday I'll send you a tip.",
  "julian.event6.c": "Don't thank me. Good clients are hard to find... and good friends, even harder.$h",
  "julian.serve.question": "How can I help you?",
  "julian.serve.terminal": "Open the Terminal",
  "julian.serve.pay": "Pay bills",
  "julian.serve.bye": "Nothing, thanks",

